IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-WEB-SECURITY-STORAGE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 HTTP-STATUS-CODE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 STORAGE-ITEM-COUNT   PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CSP-VIOLATIONS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SECURITY-AUDIT-SCORE PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SECURITY-STORAGE.
    IF HTTP-STATUS-CODE < 200 OR HTTP-STATUS-CODE >= 400
        GO TO SECURITY-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF CSP-VIOLATIONS > 0
        GO TO SECURITY-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9920 TO SECURITY-AUDIT-SCORE.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 HTTP-STATUS-CODE.
    WEIGHT 30 STORAGE-ITEM-COUNT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

SECURITY-ERROR.
    MOVE 0 TO SECURITY-AUDIT-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
